{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000571","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000571"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000571","label":"后勝","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"后勝","mention_ids":["c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0011","c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0209"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p020","quote":"后勝"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0209","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021","quote":"后勝"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"后勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000571","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"后勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000571","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021","chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p020","text":"二十六年，齊王建與其相后勝發兵守其西界，不通秦。秦使將軍王賁從燕南攻齊，得齊王建。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"齊王建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000570","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"后勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000571","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0026","start":26,"end":30,"surface":"將軍王賁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000567","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:m020-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"齊王建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000570","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021","text":"秦王初并天下，令丞相、御史曰：「異日韓王納地效璽，請為藩臣，已而倍約，與趙、魏合從畔秦，故興兵誅之，虜其王。寡人以為善，庶幾息兵革。趙王使其相李牧來約盟，故歸其質子。已而倍盟，反我太原，故興兵誅之，得其王。趙公子嘉乃自立為代王，故舉兵擊滅之。魏王始約服入秦，已而與韓、趙謀襲秦，秦兵吏誅，遂破之。荊王獻青陽以西，已而畔約，擊我南郡，故發兵誅，得其王，遂定其荊地。燕王昏亂，其太子丹乃陰令荊軻為賊，兵吏誅，滅其國。齊王用后勝計，絕秦使，欲為亂，兵吏誅，虜其王，平齊地。寡人以眇眇之身，興兵誅暴亂，賴宗廟之靈，六王咸伏其辜，天下大定。今名號不更，無以稱成功，傳後世。其議帝號。」丞相綰、御史大夫劫、廷尉斯等皆曰：「昔者五帝地方千里，其外侯服夷服諸侯或朝或否，天子不能制。今陛下興義兵，誅殘賊，平定天下，海內為郡縣，法令由一統，自上古以來未嘗有，五帝所不及。臣等謹與博士議曰：『古有天皇，有地皇，有泰皇，泰皇最貴。』臣等昧死上尊號，王為『泰皇』。命為『制』，令為『詔』，天子自稱曰『朕』。」王曰：「去『泰』，著『皇』，采上古『帝』位號，號曰『皇帝』；他如議。」制曰：「可。」追尊莊襄王為太上皇。制曰：「朕聞太古有號毋謚，中古有號，死而以行為謐。如此，則子議父，臣議君也，甚無謂，朕弗取焉。自今已來，除謚法。朕為始皇帝。後世以計數，二世三世至于萬世，傳之無窮。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000533","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0008","start":8,"end":13,"surface":"丞相、御史","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"韓王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"趙王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官號、神祇或未定指代；不補造人物或已知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000572","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p021:m0103","start":103,"end":107,"surface":"趙公子嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000563","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p02